[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これが、あいつらがさっき見てた石よねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These must be the stones they were looking at earlier."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これを砕いて、ブレスレットに嵌める予定なのかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder if they're planning to crush these and set them in the bracelets?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "多分、そうですよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's probably it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ。なんだかすごく普通の石よね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. They look like perfectly ordinary stones, don't they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃっ！\u3000ニ、ニーナさん！\nそんなにペタペタ触ったら……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek! M-Miss Nina! You shouldn't be touching them like that...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫よ～。\n周りにだって怪しいものは何も見当たらないし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine~ There's nothing suspicious around here anyway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、さっき神官長さんがおかしくなったの、\nこの石を触った後だったよね！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But didn't the High Priest start acting weird right after touching these stones!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっと何かあるんですよっ！\u3000怒られますっ！\nそっとしときましょうよっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something's definitely wrong with them! We'll get in trouble! Let's leave them alone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バレなきゃ大丈夫よ。ちょっと持って帰ろうかしら。\n端っこをちょーっと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine as long as we don't get caught. I might just take one back with us. Just a tiny piece..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひぃっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eeep!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんた、意外と大胆ね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're braver than I expected..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって、触っただけじゃ分からなくても、\n調べたら何か分かるかもしれないじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, we might not learn anything just by touching them, but we might figure something out if we examine them properly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そりゃそうだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I guess that's true..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "団長も随分と急かしますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The director's really pushing us to hurry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "加工は俺たちの仕事じゃねぇし、とりあえず本体を\n倉庫に運んどけばお役目は終わりだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Processing ain't our job anyway. We just need to get these to the warehouse and we're done."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "油断はしないことですよ。\nそう言って急に指令が下るかもしれませんから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't let your guard down. New orders could come in at any moment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "調査団員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Survey Team Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
